What TabseN was calling was 2.5k elo knowledge, I don't really care how much you played, if you are professional and I'm not, but your Train knowledge is some low tier 5 stuff.

- You have 3 essencial spots, B main, A main and Ivy; I have no idea how most of the rounds you have none, and are just holding T spawn until 30 seconds left; CoL ran the same second round force as yesterday - B crunch, what you did was letting them check B and A main, and you decided to flash ivy with 50 seconds left, instead of playing contact - 10 IQ, since it was the only position you had, so this will cause fast rotations;

- Stop doing slow rotations around 1 min, because it's in this period that teams take info, and you got  f**k this way a bunch of times, because you hold until 1 min left, and then decide. That's some 2017 CS type sh*t;

- When you go for a contact play like you did on 17-17, the sooner the better, since there may be a rotation for B, so you should look for the solo B player and not stop on upper ramp for some random timing and then going;

- Just a random fact, every time you went B, even killing someone that wasn't not nicx, you still weren't aware that the ANCHOR of B site might be on B...

